WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 b7153cb4cdcab65abb1cb3e649485aeb

00:00:00.245 --> 00:00:02.325
Habari, karibu kwenye uchambuzi mwingine wa kina.

00:00:02.745 --> 00:00:05.605
Natumai umeona mtindo fulani kidogo,

00:00:05.924 --> 00:00:10.324
yaani, nikishatambulisha dhana, kwa mfano kitanzi cha repeat,

00:00:10.484 --> 00:00:14.724
nitakupa zoezi moja au mawili rahisi kabisa

00:00:15.044 --> 00:00:17.984
ambayo kimsingi yanachukua tu nilichokuonyesha kwenye video na

00:00:17.984 --> 00:00:19.765
kukuruhusu kukitumia kwa vitendo.

00:00:20.405 --> 00:00:24.565
Kisha nitakupa mazoezi magumu zaidi

00:00:25.245 --> 00:00:28.204
ambapo utaanza kulazimika kutumia pia ujuzi wa kutatua matatizo.

00:00:28.605 --> 00:00:31.684
Kwa sasa, unajua, zoezi hili si gumu sana.

00:00:31.684 --> 00:00:33.405
Natumai hukuliona gumu sana.

00:00:34.204 --> 00:00:37.804
Lakini tunapoendelea, mambo yatakuwa magumu zaidi.

00:00:37.924 --> 00:00:39.725
Na sababu yanazidi kuwa magumu ni kwamba

00:00:39.725 --> 00:00:42.045
tunarundika dhana moja juu ya nyingine.

00:00:42.365 --> 00:00:45.244
Kwa hiyo tayari sasa, tukiandika... siwezi kuandika.

00:00:45.244 --> 00:00:47.804
Tukiandika move na shoot,

00:00:49.244 --> 00:00:51.685
ni wazi kabisa kwako vinafanya nini, vinafanyaje kazi.

00:00:51.685 --> 00:00:56.344
Umeandika vitendakazi vingi kufikia sasa, na hivi vinaonekana, unajua,

00:00:56.344 --> 00:00:58.384
rahisi kabisa kwako. Vivyo hivyo,

00:00:58.465 --> 00:01:02.304
huenda tayari unajisikia vizuri kabisa na dhana ya repeat hii.

00:01:02.835 --> 00:01:07.665
Umeitumia katika mazoezi kadhaa sasa, na hivi karibuni itakuwa,

00:01:08.215 --> 00:01:09.984
kama kitu cha kawaida kabisa kwako.

00:01:10.864 --> 00:01:15.025
Na tunapozidi kurundika dhana, unajua, dhana 5, dhana 10,

00:01:15.025 --> 00:01:18.784
dhana 20, mawazo haya tofauti, kuita kitendakazi, kuwa na vitanzi,

00:01:19.915 --> 00:01:22.635
utaanza kulazimika kuunganisha mambo haya yote pamoja.

00:01:22.795 --> 00:01:25.834
Na hapo ndipo mambo yanaweza kuonekana magumu kidogo.

00:01:25.995 --> 00:01:31.674
Si kwamba vitanzi ni vigumu, au kuita kitendakazi ni kugumu, au kauli ya masharti,

00:01:31.674 --> 00:01:35.873
tutakayoiona hivi karibuni, ni ngumu, lakini unapojaribu kushikilia mambo haya yote

00:01:35.873 --> 00:01:39.355
akilini, na bado ni mapya, yanaweza kukulemea kidogo.

00:01:40.155 --> 00:01:43.915
Kwa hiyo nataka tu kukuhimiza uchukue muda wako na mambo.

00:01:44.394 --> 00:01:47.555
Usijali ukianza kujisikia kulemewa kidogo, unaweza kwenda kutembea kila wakati,

00:01:47.555 --> 00:01:52.805
kupumzika kidogo. Lakini nimejaribu kupanga kasi ya kila kitu ili

00:01:52.805 --> 00:01:54.685
kila wakati ujenge juu ya maarifa uliyo nayo.

00:01:54.924 --> 00:01:58.444
Na kama unahisi unafadhaika, kama mambo hayako wazi,

00:01:58.525 --> 00:02:01.685
kama unahisi nimefanya zoezi kuwa gumu mno, tafadhali,

00:02:01.685 --> 00:02:03.405
tafadhali njoo uandike kwenye jukwaa.

00:02:03.405 --> 00:02:06.844
Ninaboresha mazoezi kila mara na kuongeza mazoezi mapya.

00:02:07.004 --> 00:02:10.284
Kuna watu wengi wazuri kwenye jukwaa watakaokusaidia pia.

00:02:10.444 --> 00:02:13.884
Kwa hiyo, ndiyo, tujulishe kama unafikiri kuna kitu

00:02:13.965 --> 00:02:17.564
kinaruka sana kwa ugumu, au kama mambo yanaenda polepole.

00:02:17.564 --> 00:02:19.805
Unaweza pia kutoa alama baada ya zoezi,

00:02:20.194 --> 00:02:22.514
na mimi huenda kuziangalia na kujaribu kurekebisha mambo.

00:02:23.474 --> 00:02:26.835
Kwa hiyo kwa zoezi hili mahususi, ni rahisi kabisa.

00:02:26.835 --> 00:02:30.074
Tutapitia tu hatua kwa hatua na kufanya kitu kimoja kwa wakati.

00:02:30.074 --> 00:02:33.555
Kwa hiyo tutafanya move, na naona haijasogea mbali vya kutosha.

00:02:33.955 --> 00:02:37.875
Kwa hiyo tutafanya move tena. Na sasa naona iko mahali pazuri.

00:02:38.034 --> 00:02:40.675
Naweza kufanya shoot na tutaona hilo. Inapiga risasi.

00:02:40.914 --> 00:02:43.634
Naweza kufanya shoot mara mbili zaidi, na naona ninahitaji kufanya hivyo.

00:02:44.034 --> 00:02:45.875
Na tunaweza kuwatungua viumbe hawa wote wa angani.

00:02:46.764 --> 00:02:47.324
Move tena.

00:02:49.564 --> 00:02:51.044
Hiyo haijasogea mbali vya kutosha.

00:02:51.044 --> 00:02:51.965
Kwa hiyo nitafanya move tena.

00:02:54.604 --> 00:02:57.085
Sawa, basi tunajua ninahitaji kufanya shoot mara tatu zaidi.

00:02:57.564 --> 00:03:00.044
Na ghafla tuna mtindo unaojirudia hapa.

00:03:00.044 --> 00:03:03.004
Move, move, shoot, shoot, shoot, move, move, shoot, shoot, shoot.

00:03:03.324 --> 00:03:06.844
Hapo ndipo tunaweza kutumia tu kitanzi cha repeat.

00:03:06.925 --> 00:03:10.844
Na hicho kitaendelea kufanya kitu hicho tena, na tena.

00:03:11.735 --> 00:03:13.335
Na mara moja msimbo unafanya kazi.

00:03:13.974 --> 00:03:15.615
Kuna mambo mengine mawili unayoweza kugundua.

00:03:15.615 --> 00:03:19.455
Hili labda ni zoezi la kwanza, au labda ulishaliona kwenye zoezi

00:03:19.455 --> 00:03:23.175
lililopita pia. Lakini kila wakati tunatarajia uweke nafasi mbili hapa.

00:03:23.254 --> 00:03:27.014
Ukiweka nafasi zaidi, utapata mstari huu wa mawimbi chini.

00:03:27.094 --> 00:03:30.294
Na ukijaribu kuendesha msimbo, itasema msimbo wako umefanya kazi,

00:03:30.294 --> 00:03:32.375
lakini unahitaji kurekebisha mpangilio wako.

00:03:32.854 --> 00:03:35.655
Na hili linaweza kuonekana kama jambo la kiholela kidogo, kama vile,

00:03:35.655 --> 00:03:37.094
nikitaka kutumia nafasi nne je?

00:03:37.094 --> 00:03:38.664
Hilo linaonekana sawa kabisa kwangu.

00:03:39.944 --> 00:03:42.664
Lakini kuwa na viwango tunavyovifuata ni muhimu sana.

00:03:43.784 --> 00:03:46.384
Na ukianza kubuni viwango vyako mwenyewe na

00:03:46.384 --> 00:03:49.305
kisha ujaribu kufanya kazi na watu wengine au hata na zana za akili bandia (LLM),

00:03:49.465 --> 00:03:51.784
watachanganyikiwa sana kuhusu kinachoendelea.

00:03:52.264 --> 00:03:54.264
Na kama huna viwango vyovyote,

00:03:54.344 --> 00:03:56.944
labda utaanza kuandika msimbo kama huu, ambapo

00:03:56.944 --> 00:03:58.985
kila kitu kimevurugika tu.

00:03:59.384 --> 00:04:01.865
Utagundua kwamba inakuwa vigumu sana

00:04:01.865 --> 00:04:03.705
kwako kuelewa kinachoendelea.

00:04:04.405 --> 00:04:08.085
Kwa hiyo fuata viwango tulivyokupa, yaani nafasi mbili kati ya vitu,

00:04:09.185 --> 00:04:12.324
na utaona maisha yako yanakuwa rahisi zaidi.

00:04:12.564 --> 00:04:15.805
Kitu kimoja zaidi nataka kukuonyesha: ukipitisha kipanya hapa,

00:04:15.805 --> 00:04:19.324
utaona kuna kidoti kidogo cha rangi ya machungwa kinachotokea.

00:04:19.324 --> 00:04:21.845
Ukibofya kitu, hebu tubofye hiki,

00:04:22.564 --> 00:04:26.004
utaona mishale miwili midogo ya machungwa ikitokea chini.

00:04:27.204 --> 00:04:29.204
Jaribu kubofya mishale hiyo ya machungwa.

00:04:29.204 --> 00:04:32.625
Na unaona tutaruka ndani ya msimbo wetu hivi.

00:04:32.944 --> 00:04:34.865
Na kwa kweli tunaruka kupitia nini?

00:04:35.024 --> 00:04:39.944
Basi, tunaruka kwenye kila mara ambapo mstari wa msimbo wa move, mstari huu mmoja,

00:04:39.944 --> 00:04:44.944
mstari wa tano, unatumika. Kwa hiyo kila mara mstari huu unapoendeshwa, tunaruka kwake.

00:04:44.944 --> 00:04:51.540
Kwa kawaida tungebofya mara kadhaa kisha turudi kwenye move: 1, 2, 3, 4, 5,

00:04:51.642 --> 00:04:56.944
mibofyo 6 kati ya kila move. Lakini kwa sababu tumeweka kidoti hiki kidogo cha machungwa hapa,

00:04:56.944 --> 00:04:59.795
tunaweza kuruka moja kwa moja kila mara move inapoitwa.

00:04:59.795 --> 00:05:02.675
Na tunaweza kufanya hivi kwenye mstari wowote. Tunaweza kufanya kwenye mstari wa shoot.

00:05:02.834 --> 00:05:06.115
Na sasa unaona imeanza tu kupiga risasi.

00:05:06.675 --> 00:05:09.634
Kwa hiyo mstari huu unapoendeshwa tu, ndipo tunaruka hapo.

00:05:10.514 --> 00:05:14.834
Hizi zinaitwa breakpoint. Ni sehemu kwenye msimbo wako ambapo unataka

00:05:14.834 --> 00:05:16.194
kusimama kidogo na kuona kinachoendelea.

00:05:17.634 --> 00:05:19.754
Tunapoendelea na mazoezi magumu zaidi,

00:05:19.754 --> 00:05:21.754
hizi zitakuwa muhimu sana ili

00:05:21.754 --> 00:05:23.814
usilazimike kutafuta moja moja,

00:05:24.045 --> 00:05:26.764
kutafuta mstari hapa kuona kinachoendelea, au kulazimika

00:05:26.764 --> 00:05:29.444
kupitia hatua nyingi mara nyingi. Hapa unaweza tu

00:05:29.444 --> 00:05:34.125
kuweka breakpoint kwenye mstari unaotaka kisha usonge hadi hapo.

00:05:34.444 --> 00:05:36.324
Kwa hiyo ninapendekeza sana uzichezee

00:05:36.324 --> 00:05:39.004
kidogo unapoendelea na mazoezi yako yajayo.

00:05:39.764 --> 00:05:42.605
Sasa tutatambulisha dhana nyingine ya msingi.

00:05:42.605 --> 00:05:47.444
Tumekuwa na dhana mbili za msingi: kuita vitendakazi na vitanzi.

00:05:47.444 --> 00:05:49.485
Sasa tutaanza kuangalia variable.

00:05:49.865 --> 00:05:54.295
Na unapozirundika hizi, haitachukua muda mrefu kabla hujaanza kuandika programu

00:05:54.504 --> 00:05:58.134
ngumu zaidi na za kufurahisha. Lakini kazi nzuri kama umelitatua hili.

00:05:58.134 --> 00:06:00.454
Natarajia kukuona kwenye video nyingine hivi karibuni.

00:06:00.454 --> 00:06:01.254
Asante kwa kutazama.
